{"kelime":"برذعة","maddeler":[{"w":"برذعة","u":"برذعة","p":"noun","n":"1","h":"ar-noun","e":"بَرْذَعَة • (barḏaʕa) f (plural بَرَاذِع (barāḏiʕ))","t":"From Middle Persian [script needed] (bwlytn' /⁠burīdan⁠/, “cutting”) originally referring to scrap fabrics packed under a saddlebag; compare Armenian բուրդ (burd, “wool”), Georgian ბურდო (burdo, “chaff”), Sanskrit वर्धक (vardhaka, “shearing, cutting; carpenter”); ultimately from Proto-Indo-European *bʰerdʰ- (“cut”).","s":[["root",""],["der","Middle Persian [script needed] (bwlytn' /⁠burīdan⁠/, “cutting”)"],["cog","Armenian բուրդ (burd, “wool”)"],["cog","Georgian ბურდო (burdo, “chaff”)"],["cog","Sanskrit वर्धक (vardhaka, “shearing, cutting; carpenter”)"],["der","Proto-Indo-European *bʰerdʰ- (“cut”)"]],"g":["packsaddle"],"r":["barḏaʕa"],"ipa":["/bar.ða.ʕa/"],"el":[["բուրդ","բուրդ#Armenian"],["ბურდო","ბურდო#Georgian"],["वर्धक","वर्धक#Sanskrit"],["*bʰerdʰ-","Reconstruction:Proto-Indo-European/bʰerdʰ-"]],"yol":""},{"w":"برذعة","u":"برذعة","p":"name","n":"2","h":"ar-proper noun","e":"بَرْذَعَة • (barḏaʕa) f","t":"Borrowed from Old Armenian Պարտաւ (Partaw).","s":[["bor","Old Armenian Պարտաւ (Partaw)"],["wp",""]],"g":["Partav, Barda (A city in Azerbaijan)"],"r":["barḏaʕa"],"ipa":["/bar.ða.ʕa/"],"el":[["Պարտաւ","Պարտաւ#Old_Armenian"]],"yol":""}]}